  "description": "“If you endure tonight well, I shall grant you a reward.” \n\nThe emperor’s army, having brought an end to a three-year war, stormed into the small walled town of Doha. Nanhee, a maidservant, is chosen as a lustful plaything to satisfy the emperor’s desires. But the emperor, who had promised her a reward, suddenly leaves after only two days. Taking advantage of the confusion, Nanhee decides to run away. \n\n“How dare you flee without even receiving my permission?” \n\n“Enough. Let’s start with your punishment, you wicked little thing.” \n\nBut… wasn’t I supposed to be nothing more than a one-night lust plaything? Your Majesty, why are you doing this to me?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14244136)",
